   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam South Africa NPC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam South Africa is an independent Oxfam affiliate who manages and implements the programme of Oxfam in South Africa. Its programme prioritises vulnerable communities and creating lasting change in, and for all the people in South Africa. Oxfam South Africa works in partnership with organisations who seek to create meaningful and sustainable change that benefits vulnerable groups in South Africa through the attainment, protection and preservation of human rights and social justice. The country program will continue to focus its work through &#x91;active citizenship and
accountability&#x92; and &#x91;gender justice&#x92; lenses.</narrative>
